     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-race-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-race-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-race-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2028-9</td><td>Asian</td></tr><tr><td>2054-5</td><td>Black, African or African American</td></tr><tr><td>2135-2</td><td>Hispanic or Latino/a/e</td></tr><tr><td>2118-8</td><td>Middle Eastern or North African</td></tr><tr><td>1002-5</td><td>Native American, Alaska Native, or Indigenous</td></tr><tr><td>2076-8</td><td>Native Hawaiian or Pacific Islander</td></tr><tr><td>2106-3</td><td>White</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html#ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
